.worktrees/
.DS_Store

# §19.1 sensitive local state
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.crt
*.cer
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
*service-account*.json
.inkmigrate/
# reports/logs 仅锚定仓库根；若包内也会生成同类目录，需去掉根锚定覆盖任意层级
/reports/
/logs/
*.log
playwright/.auth/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.enex
# 如需提交 .sqlite/.enex 测试 fixtures，显式取消忽略（精确到扩展名）：
# 注意 git 无法重新包含父目录已被忽略（/logs/、dist/ 等）的文件
# !**/tests/fixtures/**/*.sqlite
# !**/tests/fixtures/**/*.enex
# 现状：evernote fixtures 由 `pnpm --filter @inkmigrate/source-evernote gen:fixtures`
# 本地生成、不入库，fresh clone/CI 需先运行该命令

# build artifacts（dist/ 未锚定，匹配任意层级；如某包需提交 dist 产物，
# 用 !packages/<pkg>/dist/** 显式取反）
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

docs/superpowers/

# § ui-ux-pro-max skill: bundled binary fonts (TTF) — keep skill, skip fonts in git
# 字体不入库且仓库内无下载脚本：fresh clone 后 canvas-fonts/ 为空，
# ui-styling 的 canvas 检索会降级（见 references/canvas-design-system.md）
.zcode/skills/ui-styling/canvas-fonts/
